+ * ZEST f2fs glue: cold curseg zone evacuation + zone-state summary.
+ *
+ * After step-1 redirect (COLD_DATA/NODE -> WARM in __get_segment_type
+ * and gc.c) the cold cursegs receive no new writes, but their zones
+ * still hold the old valid blocks and occupy an open-zone slot on
+ * the device. CLOSE on those zones is rejected by firmware
+ * (-EREMOTEIO from ASC 0x20/0x24), so we evacuate the section via
+ * targeted GC and RESET the zone -- that returns the open-zone
+ * budget to the device and produces an EMPTY zone we can later
+ * donate to the swapfile.
