+ *     curseg out, run targeted f2fs_gc on the vacated section
+ *     until valid_blocks==0, then REQ_OP_ZONE_RESET the underlying
+ *     zone. RESET is safe here because SIT no longer references
+ *     any block in the section.
+ *
+ *   - f2fs_zest_zone_summary_emit(): blkzone-report-style summary
+ *     suitable for sysfs read, so we can verify zone state without
+ *     a userspace blkzone tool.
